      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would really like this to be an option. Personally, I've noticed that many people I hang out with really dislike the disruption the new UI changes have caused to \"world hopping\". \n\nIn the past, you would find a spare corner and drop a portal. Now, it is a multi step process where you need to actively fight the UI to proceed. To start with, you can't click Drop Portal, because the default is locked. You have to click Create Instance, then select the desired restriction level (usually Friends+). And then! You need to click the unlock icon, and THEN hit Drop Portal! \n\nAnd when someone makes a mistake in any of these steps, it throws the whole group into chaos! \"No, don't enter that portal!\" \"What's taking them so long to load? Wait... oh no!\" \"Uhh, guys? I can't see the portal...\" \"Uhh, they vanished? Did they enter the instance instead of dropping it? Does anyone know where they went?\" Please, this is so painful! It makes exploring so hard!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
